  "body": "Perched in an elevated, north-facing position and bathed in sun, this freehold standalone home was built and thoughtfully up-spec'd by its current owners — and it shows in the detail. From the moment you step inside you can feel the quality, and this one just feels like home.\r\n\r\n• Freehold standalone home — no body corporate, no cross-lease complications\r\n• Generous, spacious layout with four genuine good sized bedrooms\r\n• Ground floor living opening seamlessly to the outdoors — effortless indoor-outdoor flow for everyday living and entertaining\r\n• Built and up-spec'd by the current owners, with quality craftsmanship and attention to detail throughout\r\n• Elevated, sunny, north-facing aspect capturing all-day light\r\n• A rare combination of space, position and build quality in this price bracket\r\n\r\nThis is a home commissioned by owners who didn't cut corners — and it's ready for its next chapter. Our vendors are committed to the sales process and genuinely ready to sell, so disregard the CV of $1.325M and come see it for yourself. Homes of this calibre in this position don't sit for long — make your offer before it goes.",
